! ============================================================================
! Yanshansin dictionary — batch 4 (letters З-И-Й-К), TONE-AWARE.
! Each entry carries its Gansu-standard headword tone <t1>/<t2>/<t3> so that
! same-spelling same-POS homographs stay distinct (e.g. за 扎/炸/榨). Tone data
! from the dictionary's I/II/III marks. Motivated by 1928-1953 Latin Dungan,
! which could spell tone into the string where Cyrillic drops it.
! Tone grounding [Поливанов 1937]: the Gansu standard has three tonemes (vs.
! four in Shaanxi) — tone I (level, "zero"/privative member) merges N.Chinese
! tones 1+2+5(entering); II falling, III rising. Polivanov argued AGAINST
! obligatory tone marking in the orthography (cf. optional Russian stress), so
! the homography these tags resolve is built into the writing norm.
! SCOPE: the tone tag resolves TONE-homography only, not full homonymy of
! same-tone stems (Поливанов 1937: тон-I суп / сахар) — such pairs stay
! genuinely ambiguous; tone sandhi and деплациация are likewise not modelled.
! Routing: inanim nouns + adverbs end after tone; animate nouns chain to a
! tone-specific number slot; verbs/adjectives reuse the aspect/degree slots.
! ============================================================================
LEXICON T1-N-NN
%<n%>%<nn%>%<t1%>:  NounEnd ;

LEXICON T1-N-AN
%<n%>%<an%>%<t1%>:  T1-N-AN-Num ;

LEXICON T1-N-AN-Num
%<sg%>:        NounEnd ;
%<pl%>:%>му    NounEnd ;

LEXICON T1-V
%<vblex%>%<t1%>:  VAspSlot ;

LEXICON T1-Adj
%<adj%>%<t1%>:  AdjDeg ;

LEXICON T1-Adv
%<adv%>%<t1%>:  # ;

LEXICON T2-N-NN
%<n%>%<nn%>%<t2%>:  NounEnd ;

LEXICON T2-N-AN
%<n%>%<an%>%<t2%>:  T2-N-AN-Num ;

LEXICON T2-N-AN-Num
%<sg%>:        NounEnd ;
%<pl%>:%>му    NounEnd ;

LEXICON T2-V
%<vblex%>%<t2%>:  VAspSlot ;

LEXICON T2-Adj
%<adj%>%<t2%>:  AdjDeg ;

LEXICON T2-Adv
%<adv%>%<t2%>:  # ;

LEXICON T3-N-NN
%<n%>%<nn%>%<t3%>:  NounEnd ;

LEXICON T3-N-AN
%<n%>%<an%>%<t3%>:  T3-N-AN-Num ;

LEXICON T3-N-AN-Num
%<sg%>:        NounEnd ;
%<pl%>:%>му    NounEnd ;

LEXICON T3-V
%<vblex%>%<t3%>:  VAspSlot ;

LEXICON T3-Adj
%<adj%>%<t3%>:  AdjDeg ;

LEXICON T3-Adv
%<adv%>%<t3%>:  # ;

